  "solution": "Ta có sơ đồ hình cây như sau:\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ecd9eec6b8a6a4d8cbf4fd90ba12b1a44e732e21bb622764e21e872e08095e55.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ul class=\"\"><li>Dựa vào sơ đồ hình cây trên ta có xác suất cần tìm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Dựa vào sơ đồ hình cây ta có xác suất cần tìm là \n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>56</mn><mn>165</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>",
